{"ref":"BDB, גֵּו","hw":"גֵּו","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּו</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>back</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּו</span> abs. not found, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.13\">Pr 10:13</a> + 2 times, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּוִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.6\">Is 50:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּוְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּוֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.23\">51:23</a>;—<em>back</em>, as beaten, lashed <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.13\">Pr 10:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.29\">19:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.3\">26:3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.6\">Is 50:6</a>; in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׁלִיךְ אַחֲרֵי ג׳</span> (as <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּו</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.17\">Is 38:17</a>, of Yahweh’s casting sins of penitent behind his back, putting them out of mind; as trodden upon <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.23\">Is 51:23</a>, fig. of extreme humiliation.","next":"BDB, גֵּו²","prev":"BDB, גַּו²"}